Package: h3c-campus
Version: 0.2.7-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Local package builder <local@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, iproute2
Recommends: pkexec
Description: H3C EAP-MD5 campus client with desktop interface
 Independent Python implementation for a wired campus connection.
 Desktop prompts without storing credentials; optional scheduled login uses a root-only password file.
